      "id": "claim_c6363ddfd64f4f0e9d5c066b07eae1d1",
      "statement": "src/styles.css is the entire visual layer of the starter — plain CSS with no framework coupling — and is deliberately disposable: its header labels it a high-craft mockup meant to be copied verbatim or replaced outright, and the default-skin section is marked DELETE ME.",
