    {
      "id": "claim_2738a7e93d284a4cafa3bc5cca9f7bc9",
      "statement": "styles.css is organised as numbered sections: 1 Design tokens (:root) as the single source of colour, type, space, shape, motion, elevation and focus; an unnumbered Dark mode block (:root.dark) that overrides only the colour and elevation tokens; 2 Base element defaults; 3 Default skin (the DELETE ME class-hook rules); 4 Auth pages; 5 Config page; 6 Responsive at max-width 560px; 7 Reduced motion. Because every colour flows through a token, dark mode needs no per-component work.",
