    {
      "id": "claim_49916238cbab44f596d55653e4f92ce0",
      "statement": "ThemeService (src/app/theme.service.ts) owns the light/dark toggle: a dark signal, and toggle() adds or removes the .dark class on document.documentElement while persisting the choice in localStorage['rh-theme'] as 'dark' or 'light'. localStorage and document do not exist on the server, so the service guards all such access behind isPlatformBrowser(PLATFORM_ID) — the auth pages are prerendered, and a port that touches these APIs during SSR/prerender will crash without the same guard.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://PORTING.md#L162-L172",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:475c2d1a55631b8792f49a7e1d6ce1912621ea98089d18662ef0d29a2a52ec9f:"
