    {
      "id": "claim_cc33125651e941edb6c5a87a22696daf",
      "statement": "Alert (src/app/ui/alert/alert.ts) is the single shared feedback component: presentational, with no stylesheet of its own, rendering only the .success-msg / .form-error class hooks plus the matching ARIA role (status for success, alert for error). Its type input picks both hook and role; dismissible (default true) renders an aria-label=\"Dismiss\" button; autoDismiss (default 4000ms, 0 disables) emits close after the delay; the close output fires on dismiss or elapsed auto-dismiss and the parent owns the state and must reset its own signal in the handler.",
