    {
      "id": "claim_4c978ff6d53a43ba906390e89771a300",
      "statement": "The portable-vs-rebuild matrix from PORTING.md: @ulabase/kit (auth, teams, invitations, profile, password) and src/styles.css (tokens + default skin) are 100% portable — depend on the kit directly and copy the stylesheet verbatim; templates are portable in structure but not syntax, porting markup while keeping the same semantic class hooks; page CSS content copies but its scoping swaps (CSS Modules / <style scoped>); @ulabase/kit-ng, routing/guards/titles/SSR config are not portable and must be rebuilt to the documented contract; component classes are rebuilt in behaviour (per TEMPLATE_API.md) though not in syntax.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://PORTING.md#L13-L32",
