        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b80caba5c31347ec9ce6f80904280e7d",
      "statement": "Cross-cutting behaviours a port must reproduce: capture the access_token from window.location.hash and consume the one-shot ?flow=signup marker in memory only, then clear both via history.replaceState; register an empty route table and render the connect-your-service screen when apiUrl is unconfigured; feature flags gate the client route, the SSR/prerender route entry, and every link/UI block offering the feature (a server-side-off feature returns 403); OAuth is a plain anchor to ${apiUrl}/auth/oauth/authorize/${provider}?noauthchallenge, not a fetch; activate, reset-password and switch-team use ?delivery=body so the new access_token arrives in the same response with no follow-up POST /token; the theme is .dark on the document element persisted in localStorage['rh-theme'] with browser access guarded.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://PORTING.md#L89-L172",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1a17a375cabb13e87e27455f0e90c4b34bbe9ca31dd87e87f8762fba2cc65bd7:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_13e19233ec1b43ab9191389613f846eb",
      "statement": "Behaviour-parity UX patterns to preserve app-wide: one feedback component with auto-dismiss, manual dismiss and correct ARIA whose parent owns the state; success messages clear on edit (subscribe to form changes before seeding initial values); every list has loading, empty and populated states; destructive actions confirm inline rather than with window.confirm; in-flight actions disable their own row/button and swap the label; a navigation progress bar during lazy route loads; a 5-minute invitation-resend cooldown with remaining time on the button; users cannot remove themselves from a team; team creation stays on the page after success.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://PORTING.md#L203-L223",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4b3f5b203f9a199e62f82884ac7a34ecef9295baec93223633f5b974b1e7f195:"
        }
