      "statement": "A port should keep the same file layout (pages/auth/, pages/teams/, ui/alert/, …) and component names so the Angular, React and Vue versions stay reviewable side by side and one document can serve all of them; the framework mapping table translates signals/computed, services/inject, reactive forms, @if/@for, styleUrl encapsulation, TitleStrategy and SSR render modes to their React and Vue equivalents.",
